# Pairs with GateOwnership. Marking C moved away mid-split would strand the split's half.
MODULE: ConsolidationIgnoresBusyGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: consolidation takes C's split gate while another turn holds it
PERTURBS: ConsolidationTakeGate

--- FIND
    /\ cons = "running"
    /\ gate["C"] = "free"
--- REPLACE
    /\ cons = "running"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is not awaited
--- END
